+Forge resolves its card database and other resources under an assets directory
+that contains `res/` (normally `forge-gui/`). By default the harness resolves
+that relative to the current working directory, so it must be launched from
+`forge-gui-desktop`:
 
 ```bash
 cd forge-gui-desktop
@@ -30,6 +33,21 @@ java -Djava.awt.headless=true \
