The priority decision offered only playable abilities, so a client could never
choose to pass. The witness spin guard (which forces a pass when a run spins on a
no-op action) could therefore never fire, and the pilot burned its observation
budget on e.g. Helm's Equip {5} without ever reaching combat, so
